From 74a444054e5e3f6af5e26e81e7a83532486c35b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 10:32:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Peanuts Nova: the modding analysis's progress in the app

ModAnalysisService writes its state to files/mod-analysis-status.txt (the
app's processes share it): starting, running with bundles read / total,
done with the zip's path, or failed. Lancer asks for the notification
permission (Android 13+; Nova never prepares, which asked it before) and
opens a window that reads that state every second: the stage, a bar,
how long since the last news, and a hint when the engine goes quiet. A
second tap while one runs shows its progress instead of starting another.
---
 .../dev/nxnative/android/MainActivity.java    | 53 +++++++++++++++++--
 .../nxnative/android/ModAnalysisService.java  | 32 +++++++++--
 2 files changed, 78 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

diff --git a/android/app/src/main/java/dev/nxnative/android/MainActivity.java b/android/app/src/main/java/dev/nxnative/android/MainActivity.java
